From: fi3 <you@example.com>
Date: Thu, 25 Jun 2026 09:36:03 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] ADD review-completion confirmation so patch chats close
 deliberately

After a reviewer reports no findings, the controller asks the patch agent whether the feature is done and selects that chat so the terminal can handle the decision explicitly. A yes answer hides the patch-agent row and returns to the command surface; a later follow-up reopens the same patch chat so the user can continue work without sending the answer to the backend.
